      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `ee216a2e11392f8568e05a8d94757ec47ac3f4b4c5d1282c36eb7e2bcaede45a--2.-Defendants-with-a-guilty-outcome-Australia-Tables-7-to-11-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2019-20\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | bfdfb77b02c18859026d3176cc941bbbdffcde9c443df384afe41096040580c8 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 881dcb142fdaaeab9fed3cf53983e45928949cdc4ba1227172b9a085b9787d06 | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | 279670e0f4f4377453da509cd7a735c00758034585cdadf4c5308629b8b92d2a | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | 1201b18d68502fae2c0ba84f19a7def210d2bddcfedcd332de4a8f78eb361b3d | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | 49c63731633f0263648d151c570cec3be9e3c367c0673e21b86da468991af1bb | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | 6876224bffea214a8ab04afef6c35756e3c763225f5ad6631edd04b2f25f8728 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
